---
/**
 * The horizontal hairline that separates one page section from the next.
 *
 * A thematic break rather than decoration, so it is an `<hr>`: the sections it
 * sits between are genuinely different subjects. It runs full bleed, matching
 * the rules that close the featured grid, and uses the one stroke weight and
 * color shared by every hairline on the site.
 */
---

<hr class="section-rule" />

<style>
  .section-rule {
    height: var(--border-hairline-width);
    margin: 0;
    border: 0;
    background-color: var(--border-hairline);
  }
</style>
